  'bochuzoku': {"html": "<div class=\"umamusume-intro\" style=\"color:#D2691E;border-color:#D2691E;\">\n<div class=\"uma-img\" style=\"border-color:#D2691E;\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://mobile.moegirl.org.cn/%E6%9C%9B%E6%97%8F\" title=\"望族\"><img src=\"/uma_moe/bochuzoku.png\" alt=\"望族\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-detail\">\n<div class=\"uma-basic\">\n<div class=\"uma-name\" style=\"color:#D2691E;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://mobile.moegirl.org.cn/%E6%9C%9B%E6%97%8F\" title=\"望族\"><span style=\"color:#D2691E; line-height:100%;\">望族<br /><span style=\"font-size:70%;margin-top:-10px;\"><span lang=\"ja\"> モンジュー </span></span></span></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-cv\" style=\"color:#D2691E;\">\n<p><span>CV：<a href=\"https://mobile.moegirl.org.cn/%E6%AB%BB%E5%BA%AD%E6%9C%89%E7%BA%B1\" title=\"樱庭有纱\"><span style=\"color:#D2691E;\">樱庭有纱</span></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-info\">\n<table class=\"uma-info-table\" style=\"color:#D2691E;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生日：4月4日</td>\n<td>身高：？？cm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">体重：？？\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">三围：B？？·W？？·H？？\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-description\" style=\"color:#D2691E;border-color:#D2691E;\">\n<p>望族是一位来自法国的赛马娘，也是世界上最熟练的赛车手之一。她在凯旋门大奖赛上对阵 El Condor Pasa，并在最后百米内超越 取得胜利。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "zh": "望族", "ja": "モンジュー", "en": "Montjeu", "cv_zh": "樱庭有纱", "color": "#D2691E"}
