  'teppen_commentator_honizumi': {"html":"<div class=\"umamusume-intro\" style=\"color:#7A6FF0;border-color:#7A6FF0;\">\n<div class=\"uma-img\" style=\"border-color:#7A6FF0;align-items:center;\">\n<div style=\"width:88%;aspect-ratio:3/4;min-height:240px;margin:12px auto;border:2px dashed #7A6FF0;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#7A6FF0;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:3px;\">暂无立绘</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-detail\">\n<div class=\"uma-basic\">\n<div class=\"uma-name\" style=\"color:#7A6FF0;\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#7A6FF0; line-height:100%;\">解说（泉本奈奈）<br /><span style=\"font-size:70%;margin-top:-10px;\"><span lang=\"ja\"> 実況（泉本奈々） </span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-cv\" style=\"color:#7A6FF0;\">\n<p><span>CV：<a href=\"https://mobile.moegirl.org.cn/%E6%9C%AC%E6%B3%89%E8%8E%89%E5%A5%88\" title=\"本泉莉奈\"><span style=\"color:#7A6FF0\">本泉莉奈</span></a></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-info\">\n<table class=\"uma-info-table\" style=\"color:#7A6FF0;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生日：？？</td>\n<td>身高：？？cm</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">体重：？？</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">三围：B？？·W？？·H？？</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-description\" style=\"color:#7A6FF0;border-color:#7A6FF0;\">\n<p>一位才华横溢的播音员，为 Twinkle 系列提供现场评论。她还出现在电影《新时代之门》中，并公布了他的名字。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","zh":"解说（泉本奈奈）","ja":"実況（泉本奈々）","en":"","cv_zh":"本泉莉奈","color":"#7A6FF0"},
  'teppen_commentator_yamamoto': {"html":"<div class=\"umamusume-intro\" style=\"color:#6A5FD0;border-color:#6A5FD0;\">\n<div class=\"uma-img\" style=\"border-color:#6A5FD0;align-items:center;\">\n<div style=\"width:88%;aspect-ratio:3/4;min-height:240px;margin:12px auto;border:2px dashed #6A5FD0;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#6A5FD0;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:3px;\">暂无立绘</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-detail\">\n<div class=\"uma-basic\">\n<div class=\"uma-name\" style=\"color:#6A5FD0;\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#6A5FD0; line-height:100%;\">《巅峰之路》解说<br /><span style=\"font-size:70%;margin-top:-10px;\"><span lang=\"ja\"> 『ROAD TO THE TOP』実況 </span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-cv\" style=\"color:#6A5FD0;\">\n<p><span>CV：<a href=\"https://mobile.moegirl.org.cn/%E5%B1%B1%E6%9C%AC%E6%98%8C%E5%B9%BF\" title=\"山本昌广\"><span style=\"color:#6A5FD0\">山本昌广</span></a></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-info\">\n<table class=\"uma-info-table\" style=\"color:#6A5FD0;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生日：？？</td>\n<td>身高：？？cm</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">体重：？？</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">三围：B？？·W？？·H？？</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"uma-description\" style=\"color:#6A5FD0;border-color:#6A5FD0;\">\n<p>以现实生活中的前职业棒球投手、棒球评论员和体育评论员山本正为原型，他也因对赛马有着深厚的了解而闻名，除第三集外均由山本亲自配音。然而，在片尾字幕中，他写的是他的真名“山本昌广”，而不是他的活跃名字“山本昌”。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","zh":"《巅峰之路》解说","ja":"『ROAD TO THE TOP』実況","en":"","cv_zh":"山本昌广","color":"#6A5FD0"},
